<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 text-center">
  <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto mb-6 bg-red-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
    <i class="fas fa-xmark text-red-600 text-3xl"></i>
  </div>
  <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Pembayaran Belum Berhasil</h1>
  <p class="text-gray-500 mb-8">Pembayaran dibatalkan, gagal diproses, atau waktu pembayaran sudah habis.</p>

  <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6 text-left mb-8">
    <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Beberapa hal yang bisa Anda coba:</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-circle-check text-indigo-500 mt-1"></i>Periksa kembali saldo atau limit kartu/e-wallet Anda</li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-circle-check text-indigo-500 mt-1"></i>Pastikan koneksi internet stabil saat proses pembayaran</li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-circle-check text-indigo-500 mt-1"></i>Coba lakukan pemesanan ulang dengan metode pembayaran lain</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center">
    <% if (order && order.event) { %>
    <a href="/events/<%= order.event.slug %>" class="bg-indigo-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
      <i class="fas fa-rotate-right"></i> Pesan Ulang
    </a>
    <% } %>
    <a href="/orders" class="bg-white border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
      Lihat Pesanan Saya
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
